Source: linhub
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: LinHub <linhub@localhost>
Standards-Version: 4.5.1
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, qtbase5-dev, qtbase5-dev-tools, pkg-config
Homepage: https://github.com/linhub/linhub
Package: linhub
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, openssh-client
Recommends: telnet, minicom
Description: Terminal session manager for Kylin Linux
 LinHub combines MobaXterm-style multi-protocol terminals with Xshell-style
 session library, logging and compose bar. Sessions are stored in SQLite
 with no practical limit.
